# CI / CD

Workflow: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. Details: `docs/ci.md`, `DEPLOY.md`.

## Done (short)

- Actions `lint-and-typecheck` on PRs/push to `development`/`main`; draft PRs skip CI + preview (`draft-pr-checks.mdc`)
- Prod deploy on `main` after lint + schema sync gate + `/api/health`; `vercel.json` auto-deploy OFF on `main`
- Node 24; `prisma generate` with dummy `DATABASE_URL` in CI

## Blockers / next

- Branch protection needs GitHub Pro on private Free (403) — until then: no merge on red CI
- Secrets before gated prod release: `VERCEL_TOKEN`, `VERCEL_ORG_ID`, `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID`
- Optional: `DATABASE_URL_PRODUCTION` (Neon main direct) for schema gate
- Optional: Vercel Deployment Checks → `lint-and-typecheck`; Phase 2 `npm run build` in Actions
